/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Jackson County came in under 90% of normal in March to April in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that middle ran 150% of normal in May to June and fell to 35% in October to November. So far in 2026 it shows 165% in April to May. Grid 10633 had its driest year in 2011 at 41% of normal.</p>"}
